      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "亮出見高祖，高祖曰：「顛而不扶，安用彼相。」",
      "reading": "高祖斥責亮居相位不扶危。",
      "note": "高祖斥責亮居相位不扶危。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 44,
      "end_codepoint": 66,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence4-66",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "而弗之罪也。",
      "reading": "高祖寬宥亮。",
      "note": "高祖寬宥亮。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 66,
      "end_codepoint": 72,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence4-72",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "霸府開，以爲大司馬長史、撫軍將軍、琅邪、清河二郡太守。",
      "reading": "霸府開，受長史、太守等。",
      "note": "霸府開，受長史、太守等。",
