      "start_codepoint": 72,
      "end_codepoint": 99,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence4-99",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "梁臺建，授侍中、尚書令，固讓不拜，乃爲侍中、中書監，兼尚書令。",
      "reading": "梁臺建，辭侍中尚書令後，為侍中、中書監兼尚書令。",
      "note": "梁臺建，辭侍中尚書令後，為侍中、中書監兼尚書令。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 99,
      "end_codepoint": 130,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence4-130",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "高祖受禪，遷侍中、尚書令、中軍將軍，引參佐命，封豫寧縣公，邑二千戶。",
      "reading": "梁受禪，亮參佐命，封豫寧縣公、邑二千戶。",
      "note": "梁受禪，亮參佐命，封豫寧縣公、邑二千戶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p004",
