      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "天監二年，轉左光祿大夫，侍中、中軍如故。",
      "reading": "天監二年轉左光祿。",
      "note": "天監二年轉左光祿。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 164,
      "end_codepoint": 184,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence4-184",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "元日朝會萬國，亮辭疾不登殿，設饌別省，而語笑自若。",
      "reading": "元日辭疾，別省設饌語笑。",
      "note": "元日辭疾，別省設饌語笑。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 184,
      "end_codepoint": 209,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence4-209",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "數日，詔公卿問訊，亮無疾色，御史中丞樂藹奏大不敬，論棄市刑。",
      "reading": "數日後樂藹奏大不敬，論棄市。",
      "note": "數日後樂藹奏大不敬，論棄市。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 209,
      "end_codepoint": 239,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence4-239",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "詔削爵廢爲庶人。",
