      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "四年夏，高祖讌於華光殿，謂羣臣曰：「朕日昃聽政，思聞得失。",
      "reading": "天監四年夏，帝在華光殿求得失。",
      "note": "天監四年夏，帝在華光殿求得失。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 29,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence5-29",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "卿等可謂多士，宜各盡獻替。」",
      "reading": "帝令群臣盡獻替。",
      "note": "帝令群臣盡獻替。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 29,
      "end_codepoint": 43,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence5-43",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "尚書左丞范縝起曰：「司徒謝朏本有虛名，陛下擢之如此，前尚書令王亮頗有治實，陛下棄之如彼，是愚臣所不知。」",
      "reading": "范縝對舉謝朏、王亮，質疑二人任用。",
      "note": "范縝對舉謝朏、王亮，質疑二人任用。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 43,
      "end_codepoint": 95,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence5-95",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "高祖變色曰：「卿可更餘言。」",
      "reading": "帝命縝更言。",
      "note": "帝命縝更言。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 95,
      "end_codepoint": 109,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
