      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "縝固執不已，高祖不悅。",
      "reading": "縝執不改，帝不悅。",
      "note": "縝執不改，帝不悅。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 109,
      "end_codepoint": 120,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence5-120",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "御史中丞任昉因奏曰：",
      "reading": "以下任昉彈奏。",
      "note": "以下任昉彈奏。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 120,
      "end_codepoint": 130,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "臣聞息夫歷詆，漢有正刑；白褒一奏，晉以明罰。",
      "reading": "任昉以漢息夫、晉白褒作奏議先例。",
      "note": "任昉以漢息夫、晉白褒作奏議先例。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 22,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-22",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "況乎附下訕上，毀譽自口者哉。",
      "reading": "詰附下訕上者。",
      "note": "詰附下訕上者。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 22,
      "end_codepoint": 36,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-36",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "風聞尚書左丞臣范縝，自晉安還，語人云：「我不詣餘人，惟詣王亮；不餉餘人，惟餉王亮。」",
      "reading": "傳聞范縝自晉安還，只訪、饋王亮，第一人稱為縝。",
      "note": "傳聞范縝自晉安還，只訪、饋王亮，第一人稱為縝。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 36,
      "end_codepoint": 78,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-78",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "輒收縝白從左右萬休到臺辨問，與風聞符同。",
      "reading": "任昉訊范縝從人萬休以核傳聞。",
      "note": "任昉訊范縝從人萬休以核傳聞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 78,
      "end_codepoint": 98,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-98",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "又今月十日，御餞梁州刺史臣珍國，宴私旣洽，羣臣並已謁退，時詔留侍中臣昂等十人，訪以政道。",
      "reading": "今月十日餞梁州刺史珍國，帝留侍中昂等十人問政。",
      "note": "今月十日餞梁州刺史珍國，帝留侍中昂等十人問政。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 98,
      "end_codepoint": 142,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-142",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "縝不答所問，而橫議沸騰，遂貶裁司徒臣朏，褒舉庶人王亮。",
      "reading": "奏稱縝貶司徒謝朏、褒庶人王亮。",
      "note": "奏稱縝貶司徒謝朏、褒庶人王亮。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 142,
      "end_codepoint": 169,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-169",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "臣于時預奉恩留，肩隨並立，耳目所接，差非風聞。",
      "reading": "自稱受留親見，任昉與范縝轉述區別。",
      "note": "自稱受留親見，任昉與范縝轉述區別。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 169,
      "end_codepoint": 192,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-192",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "竊尋王有遊豫，親御軒陛，義深推轂，情均《湛露》。",
      "reading": "據君王出遊、推轂與湛露申說御餞。",
      "note": "據君王出遊、推轂與湛露申說御餞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 192,
      "end_codepoint": 216,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-216",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "酒闌宴罷，當扆正立，記事在前，記言在後，軫早朝之念，深求瘼之情，而縝言不遜，妄陳褒貶，傷濟濟之風，缺側席之望。",
      "reading": "奏指縝在宴後褒貶失分。",
      "note": "奏指縝在宴後褒貶失分。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 216,
      "end_codepoint": 271,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence6-271",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "不有嚴裁，憲準將頹，縝卽主。",
      "reading": "請嚴裁。",
      "note": "請嚴裁。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 271,
      "end_codepoint": 285,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence7-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "臣謹案：尚書左丞臣范縝，衣冠緒餘，言行舛駁，誇諧里落，喧詬周行。",
      "reading": "任昉續案，所劾為范縝。",
      "note": "任昉續案，所劾為范縝。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 32,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence7-32",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "曲學諛聞，未知去代；弄口鳴舌，祇足飾非。",
      "reading": "指其學行言詞。",
      "note": "指其學行言詞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 32,
      "end_codepoint": 52,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence7-52",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "乃者，義師近次，縝丁罹艱棘，曾不呼門，墨縗景附，頗同先覺，實奉龍顏。",
      "reading": "追敘義師近時，縝居喪墨縗從梁。",
      "note": "追敘義師近時，縝居喪墨縗從梁。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 52,
      "end_codepoint": 86,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence7-86",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "而今黨協釁餘，飜爲矛楯，人而無恒，成茲姦詖。",
      "reading": "指其近與失勢者結黨。",
      "note": "指其近與失勢者結黨。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 86,
      "end_codepoint": 108,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence7-108",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "日者，飲至策勳，功微賞厚，出守名邦，入司管轄，苞篚罔遺，而假稱折轅，衣裙所弊，讒激失所，許與疵廢，廷辱民宗。",
      "reading": "指其獲賞、出守、入朝，卻廷辱宰輔。",
      "note": "指其獲賞、出守、入朝，卻廷辱宰輔。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 108,
      "end_codepoint": 162,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:received_sentence7-162",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA",
      "source_quote": "自居樞憲，糾奏寂寞。",
